    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="II Atr. Prol">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> II Atr. Prol</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis synd ða friðmal ⁊ ða forword ðe Æthelred cyng ⁊ ealle his witan wið ðone here gedon habbað, ðe Anlaf ⁊ Iustin ⁊ Guðmund Stegitan sunu mid wæron.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">These are the terms of the truce and the agreement which King Æthelred and all his councillors have made with the [Viking] fleet led by Olaf and Justin and Guðmund, the son of Stegita.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hęc sunt uerba pacis et prolocutiones, quas Æþelredus rex et omnes sapientes eius cum exercitu firmauerunt, qui cum Analauo et Iustino et Guðmundo Stegitam filio uenit.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
